As a professional software tester who writes Java test methods, generate a complete Junit 4 test file (UncheckedIOExceptionTest.java) to comprehensively test all methods in the following class named UncheckedIOException. Your output file must start with ###Test START## and finish with ###Test END##. Here is the source code:
package org.jsoup;

import java.io.IOException;

public class UncheckedIOException extends Error {
    public UncheckedIOException(IOException cause) {
        super(cause);
    }

    public IOException ioException() {
        return (IOException) getCause();
    }
}
